   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Share Sheet Carousel\n\nA share sheet springs up over a blurred backdrop, its preview cycling through four slides in quick cuts, then the Accept button is pressed.\n\nCategory: ui-blocks. Length: 7.2333 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A spot shows something being shared, received or accepted: an invite, a gift, a file.\n- A quick rhythmic slideshow sits inside a UI frame.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need real photos in the preview: this draws coloured word cards.\n- The scene should be a full chat: use chat-flow.\n\nVariables:\n- share_title (string): Sheet title, default \"Share\"\n- sender_name (string): Sender, default \"Studio\"\n- item_label (string): Item, default \"a video\"\n- strip_text (string): Strip line, default \"MADE WITH CARE \\u00b7 FRESH EVERY WEEK\"\n- accept_label (string): Accept label, default \"Accept\"\n- decline_label (string): Decline label, default \"Decline\"\n- slide_color_1 (color): Slide 1 colour, default \"#e4572e\"\n- slide_color_2 (color): Slide 2 colour, default \"#2e86ab\"\n- slide_color_3 (color): Slide 3 colour, default \"#7b4fd6\"\n- slide_color_4 (color): Slide 4 colour, default \"#2a9d6a\"\n- slide_text_1 (string): Slide 1 text, default \"Fresh\"\n- slide_text_2 (string): Slide 2 text, default \"Bold\"\n- slide_text_3 (string): Slide 3 text, default \"Simple\"\n- slide_text_4 (string): Slide 4 text, default \"Yours\"\n- accent (color): Accept colour, default \"#087a57\"\n- strip_color (color): Strip colour, default \"#f2ecdf\"\n\nSource: heygen-com/hyperframes. Licence: Apache-2.0. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
